Skill	craft:review-loop
Bash	cd <work>; git ls-files; git show --stat HEAD | cat; cat billing/*.py accounts/*.py; git remote -v; gh auth status 2>&1 | head -5; ls; cat Makefile 2>/dev/null; cat CLAUDE.md 2>/dev/null
